      "doc": "Reserved contract-error code ranges.\\n\\nCodes are a public interface: an integrator matching on `Error(Contract, #N)`\\nrelies on N never being reused for something else. Each crate owns a block and\\nnever allocates outside it.\\n\\n| Range | Owner |\\n|---|---|\\n| 1\\xe2\\x80\\x9399 | `fort-common` (this crate) |\\n| 100\\xe2\\x80\\x93199 | `fort-vault` |\\n| 200\\xe2\\x80\\x93299 | `fort-swap-router` |\\n| 300\\xe2\\x80\\x93399 | `fort-strategy-executor` |\\n| 400\\xe2\\x80\\x93499 | `fort-cross-chain-router` |\\n| 500\\xe2\\x80\\x93549 | `leverage-executor` |\\n| 550\\xe2\\x80\\x93599 | `exit-executor` |\\n| 600\\xe2\\x80\\x93699 | `fort-interfaces` (shared adapter errors) |\\n| 700\\xe2\\x80\\x93709 | `soroswap-adapter` |\\n| 710\\xe2\\x80\\x93719 | `blend-supply-adapter` |\\n| 720\\xe2\\x80\\x93729 | `blend-strategy-adapter` |\\n| 730\\xe2\\x80\\x93739 | `blend-flashloan-adapter` |\\n| 740\\xe2\\x80\\x93749 | `defindex-vault-adapter` |\\n| 750\\xe2\\x80\\x93759 | `aqua-lp-adapter` |\\n| 760\\xe2\\x80\\x93769 | `bridge-adapter` |\\n| 770\\xe2\\x80\\x93779 | `blend-flash-receiver` |\\n| 900\\xe2\\x80\\x93999 | reserved for future shared modules |\\n\\n# What is deliberately absent\\n\\nThere is no `NotOwner` variant. Authorization failures are raised by\\n`Ad",
      "lib": "",
      "name": "CommonError",
      "cases": [
        {
          "doc": "Owner is already set; initialisation may not run twice.",
          "name": "AlreadyInitialized",
          "value": 10
        },
        {
          "doc": "Contract has not been initialised.",
          "name": "NotInitialized",
          "value": 11
        },
        {
          "doc": "No ownership transfer is currently proposed.",
          "name": "NoPendingOwner",
          "value": 12
        },
        {
          "doc": "Entry point is disabled while the contract is paused.",
          "name": "Paused",
          "value": 20
        },
        {
          "doc": "Contract is not paused.",
          "name": "NotPaused",
          "value": 21
        },
        {
          "doc": "An action is already queued; only one may be pending at a time.",
          "name": "ActionAlreadyQueued",
          "value": 30
        },
